DESCRIPTION:Your reporting time for Exercise Horizon 2026 is confirmed.\n\n
 MOULAGE GROUP 3 - ARRIVE 08:00 AWST\nReport to Forster Park Community Cent
 re\, Forster Park\, Belmont WA 6104.\n\nArrival times are staggered by how
  much moulage (injury makeup) your role needs\, heaviest first. Please arr
 ive at your allocated time and not earlier - the moulage team works to thi
 s schedule.\n\nPARKING\nBelmont Sports & Recreation Club\, 400 Abernethy R
 d\, Cloverdale WA 6105.\nParking location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/FGvVXhE
 oM1re1Fv18\nThen walk north across Abernethy Road to Forster Park. The wal
 king route is attached to this invitation\, and is also at:\nhttps://nicho
 laspagonis.github.io/Exercise-Horizon-2026/assets/parking-map.jpg\n\nHOW T
 HE DAY RUNS\nCheck in at Forster Park and collect your lanyard and drawstr
 ing bag.\nMoulage is applied\, then you are briefed before moving out to t
 he airfield incident site.\nSt John WA\, ARFFS\, DFES and other responders
  triage and treat you as they would in a real emergency.\nLunch is provide
 d at Forster Park.\nThe exercise finishes at 14:00.\n\nBRING: enclosed foo
 twear\, a reusable water bottle\, older clothing you don't mind getting di
 rty\, and any personal medication you may need.\n\nFull details and role d
 escriptions: https://nicholaspagonis.github.io/Exercise-Horizon-2026\nQues
 tions: Emergency.Exercise@perthairport.com.au or 0439 237 973
